  "(Step 2: Record secondary interest & fee accrual adjustment ($11,550).) Why does this distinction matter so much when working through Free Cash Flow Modeling: Operating Inflows & Terminal Value? Because in real-world engagements, small misconfigurations in Budgeting or Decision rarely announce themselves with an obvious crash; instead, they quietly skew Finance until an independent reconciliation exposes the gap. By stepping through the logic of Valuation methodically and confirming each intermediate threshold, you build a repeatable habit that holds up under executive and regulatory scrutiny.",
