  "In this grand culminating session of Day 21, we unite all four analytical pillars into the ⭐ MILESTONE 4 CAPSTONE: Executive Corporate Capital Structure & Financial Policy Control Tower. As Executive VP of Corporate Finance and Group Treasurer of Horizon Global Industries Corporation, you present the consolidated master governance audit to the Board of Directors and Chief Executive Officer. Your master presentation delivers unified, mathematically proven recommendations across the four core dimensions of corporate financial strategy:\n1. Leverage Governance: Operating leverage (DOL = 2.00x) and financial leverage (DFL = 1.32x) synthesized into total combined leverage (DCL = 2.65x), remaining strictly within the board's 3.75x risk boundary. 2. Capital Structure Optimization: Targeting the optimal debt ratio of 20.0% Debt / 80.0% Equity, achieving a minimized corporate WACC of 10.82% and creating $1,366,707 in net enterprise market value. 3. (Step 2: Record secondary interest & fee accrual adjustment ($20,700).)",
