          explanation: "NOPAT = EBIT * (1 - T) = $10,000,000 * (1 - 0.25) = $7,500,000. Free Cash Flow to Firm (FCFF) = NOPAT + Depreciation - CapEx - Delta NWC = $7,500,000 + $2,000,000 - $2,500,000 - $500,000 = $6,500,000."
