          answerIndex: 0,
          explanation: "After-tax annual synergies = $10,000,000 * (1 - 0.25) = $7,500,000. Gross PV of synergies = $7,500,000 / 0.10 = $75,000,000. Net Present Value of synergies = Gross PV - Integration Costs = $75,000,000 - $5,000,000 = $70,000,000."
