  "Let us connect Capstone Phase 5: Grand Executive CFO Command Center & Master Accreditation directly to day-to-day practice: def execute_grand_cfo_command_center():\n    # Master Consolidation of All 4 Capstone Modules\n    cfo_summary = {\n        \"enterprise\": \"Tita, the most important discipline is verifying the underlying assumptions before acting on the headline figure. The Grand Master CFO Command Center consolidates all four phases: capital budgeting approval ($40M outlay, +$6.4M NPV), DCF equity fair value ($23.51/share), accretive M&A due diligence (+$10.57M NPV), global treasury immunization (90.91% netting, $534k swap gain), and top-decile portfolio management (Sharpe 0.783, Alpha +315 bps), which is why experienced practitioners always document both the primary calculation and the boundary conditions surrounding Officer and Modules.",
