        "output": "=== TITAN INDUSTRIAL TECHNOLOGIES ADVANCED DCF VALUATION ===\nWACC: 8.41% | Terminal Growth: 2.50%\nCumulative 5-Yr PV UFCF (Mid-Year): $102.37M\nGordon Terminal Value: $549.12M (PV: $366.71M)\nImplied Enterprise Value (EV): $469.08M\nNet Debt (Debt - Cash): $83.02M\nImplied Equity Value: $386.06M\nIntrinsic Value Per Share: $19.30\nSTATUS: DCF_ADVANCED_VALUATION_ENGINE_PASS",
