  "In Pillar 3, the base-case exit at Year 5 at ten times EBITDA achieves three billion one hundred fifty-two million dollars in enterprise value and one billion eight hundred seventy-two million dollars ($1.872B) in gross equity proceeds. The DuPont attribution reconciles: six hundred fifty-two million dollars ($652.0M, 74.8%) to EBITDA Growth, zero dollars to multiple expansion, and two hundred twenty million dollars ($220.0M, 25.2%) to Debt Paydown. Net sponsor returns achieve one point eighty-seven times MoIC (1.87x) and thirteen point three percent net IRR after ten percent management MIP dilution.",
