        "The Python script is written in clean, dependency-free standard Python (using math, json, and hashlib), ensuring 100% deterministic reproducibility across all environments. When executed, the script outputs detailed tabular audit trails for each year of the concession, confirming CFADS, sculpted principal, interest, ending debt balances, DSCR, LLCR, and sponsor cash flows, culminating in the cryptographic verification token 'PROJECT_FINANCE_NON_RECOURSE_DEBT_PASS'.",
        "Study the debt sculpting formulation implemented in the script: Annual_Debt_Service_t = CFADS_t / Target_DSCR. With interest calculated on the beginning principal balance (Interest_t = Principal_Beginning_t * Rate), the principal repayment is explicitly derived as Principal_Repayment_t = Annual_Debt_Service_t - Interest_t. The total initial debt capacity is the exact sum of these discounted sculpted principal repayments.",
