        "Project finance loan agreements also enforce strict mandatory prepayment mechanisms. Under the Excess Cash Flow (ECF) sweep covenant, any residual cash flow generated above the base case financial model must be applied\u2014fifty percent toward prepaying senior debt in inverse order of maturity and fifty percent toward the sponsor dividend account. This accelerated de-leveraging rapidly compresses the debt-to-capital ratio from 70% at commercial operation down to under 35% by Year 10, significantly enhancing the credit rating profile of the project."
