  "Engine 5 executes the sustainable finance and carbon treasury optimizer, calculating the net present value savings of the green bond greenium, simulating the SLL two-way margin ratchet across five annual verification cycles, and executing the EU ETS carbon forward compliance optimization. The engine performs programmatic cross-validation across all financial modules, verifying that every single cash balance reconciles with zero rounding leakage.",
