  "When executed, the script prints comprehensive pro forma ownership tables, cash delivery schedules, and dilution waterfall metrics, concluding with the exact cryptographic verification token 'SPAC_DESPAC_FINANCIAL_ENGINE_PASS'. Let us connect Practical Python Model: SPAC Dilution Waterfall, PIPE Sizing & Post-Merger Shareholder Returns Engine directly to day-to-day practice: Modeling a one-point-two billion dollar target de-SPAC: Simulating an 85% redemption rate, a $150M PIPE, sponsor promote earnouts, and calcu, the most important discipline is verifying the underlying assumptions before acting on the headline figure. High redemptions diminish delivered cash, making the fixed 20% promote unacceptably dilutive; PIPE investors demand promote concessions to align capital incentives, which is why experienced practitioners always document both the primary calculation and the boundary conditions surrounding billion and promote.",
